## Embed Token System
```
[[EMBED:YOUTUBE:VIDEO_ID]]      ← 11-char YouTube video ID
[[EMBED:TWEET:TWEET_ID]]        ← numeric tweet ID
[[EMBED:TIKTOK:FULL_URL]]       ← full TikTok URL without query params
```
Frontend React components render these tokens as embedded players.

