## Nuvemmag HTML Structure (IMPORTANT)
- Article content: `.content__post--article` or `.geoit_entry-content`
- Cookie banner: `.cky-consent-container`, `.cky-modal` (NOT `[class*="cookie"]`)
- Reaction bar: `.geo-reaction-wrapper`, `.geo-reaction-bar`
- Published time: `meta[property="article:published_time"]`
- OG title can contain full article text if Nuvemmag sets it wrong — current guard: if title > 100 chars, use H1/URL fallback

