## Workflow Expectations

- Workflow file: `.github/workflows/scrape-tech-news.yml`
- Scheduled daily agent runs at `07:00`, `13:00`, and `15:00` UTC on weekdays
- Concurrency must not self-cancel in-progress daily runs
- Workflow must pass a run label/date into the scraper for auditability
- Workflow must upload `artifacts/tech-news-runs/` after every run

